From 1e202180010bc0b9d5de208ee885afa182f31c62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:23:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 368/369] net: phy: mxl-gpy: fix manual LED control

Clear the hardware-control bit whenever setting a GPY LED manually.

Previously the bit remained set when turning an LED on, leaving the

hardware LED function in control of its state.

Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
---
 drivers/net/phy/mxl-gpy.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/net/phy/mxl-gpy.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/mxl-gpy.c
@@ -1062,8 +1062,7 @@ static int gpy_led_brightness_set(struct
 
 	/* clear HWCONTROL and set manual LED state */
 	ret = phy_modify(phydev, PHY_LED,
-			 ((value == LED_OFF) ? PHY_LED_HWCONTROL(index) : 0) |
-			 PHY_LED_ON(index),
+			 PHY_LED_HWCONTROL(index) | PHY_LED_ON(index),
 			 (value == LED_OFF) ? 0 : PHY_LED_ON(index));
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
